    {
      "evidenceType": "explicit_statement",
      "excerpt": "Driving the last of the seven 917s (qualified in 14th position), Richard Attwood and Hans Herrmann (Porsche Konstruktionen Salzburg) took advantage of the carnage caused by the wet weather.",
